window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>It was an average day . . . until a gorgeous demon waltzed into my coffee shop and asked me to be his mate.</b><br> <br> I jokingly agreed, but he was serious.<br> <br> And now I'm mated to him. <i>Permanently.</i><br> <br> He drinks <i>lust</i> to survive, so that makes me his immortal meal.<br> <br> If that wasn't bad enough, he's just gotten out of prison. Because I accidentally bound myself to him, I automatically take responsibility for keeping him on the right side of the law.<br> <br> So, now I'm living with a rich, dangerously-attractive demon, while a dragon shifter watches us to make sure our <i>marriage</i> is legit, and that my <i>husband</i> doesn't fall back into his sketchy ways . . . because if he does, we're both going back to prison.<br> <br> Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
